**Reasoning Steps:**

1. Atomic Requirements:
   - R1: Identify Solid actors and their roles
   - R2: Describe Solid infrastructure
   - R3: Discover data categories in Pods
   - R4: Document data handling practices
   - R5: Enable users to express privacy policies
   - R6: Record provenance metadata
   - R7: Ensure legal compliance

2. Candidate Classes and Properties:
   - Classes: Actor, Role, Infrastructure, Pod, DataCategory, DataHandlingPractice, PrivacyPolicy, User, Application, AccessMode, PersonalData, Purpose
   - Properties: hasIdentifier, hasRole, providesInfrastructure, hasPod, hasDataCategory, handlesData, creates, issues, assignee, uses, requestsAccessMode, accesses, forPurpose

3. Draft Axioms:
   - (Not showing all axioms for brevity)
   - :Actor rdfs:subClassOf [rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class].
   - :Role rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class.
   - :Infrastructure rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class.
   - :Pod rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class.
   - :DataCategory rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class.
   - :DataHandlingPractice rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class.
   - :PrivacyPolicy rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class.
   - :User rdfs:subClassOf :Actor.
   - :Application rdfs:subClassOf :Actor.
   - :AccessMode rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class.
   - :PersonalData rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class.
   - :Purpose rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class.
   - :hasIdentifier rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Actor ; rdfs:range xsd:string.
   - :hasRole rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Actor ; rdfs:range :Role.
   - :providesInfrastructure rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Actor ; rdfs:range :Infrastructure.
   - :hasPod rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Actor ; rdfs:range :Pod.
   - :hasDataCategory rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Pod ; rdfs:range :DataCategory.
   - :handlesData rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Pod ; rdfs:range :DataHandlingPractice.
   - :creates rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :PrivacyPolicy ; rdfs:range :User.
   - :issues rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :PrivacyPolicy ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime.
   - :assignee rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :PrivacyPolicy ; rdfs:range :User.
   - :uses rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Application ; rdfs:range :Pod.
   - :requestsAccessMode rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Application ; rdfs:range :AccessMode.
   - :accesses rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Application ; rdfs:range :PersonalData.
   - :forPurpose rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Application ; rdfs:range :Purpose.